    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25984" root="ضم" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضِّمُّ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضِّمَامُ</span></b>  <i>Severe calamity</i> or <i>misfortune;</i> (K, TA;) accord. to Lth: (TA:) but
app. mistranscriptions, and correctly with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ص</span>
[i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الصِّمُّ</span> and, by implication, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الصِّمَامُ</span>, but the
latter is app. only <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَمَامِ</span>, without the art., like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَامِ</span>]; (K, TA;) so says Az. (TA.)

